---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Tony Su — engineer, builder, and podcast host in the Bay Area."
>
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Hi, I’m Tony.</h1>
    <div class="body-copy">
      <p>
        I’m a software engineer in the Bay Area working in Ad Tech. Outside
        work, I explore AI products, investing, and conversations with people
        from different fields. My projects include music discovery and
        conversational recommendation systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        In 2019, I participated in the 42 Piscine in the Bay Area. My path later
        took me to an exchange at Southampton, then to studying and working in
        the US. Along the way, I served as president of my university’s
        international student association. My entrepreneurial projects include
        Chideo, an online Chinese-language education platform, followed by
        co-founding QuantX. I’m also a guest lecturer in quantitative trading at
        Soochow University in Taiwan. Through QuantX, our team has been invited
        to share quantitative trading with Taiwanese companies, including
        MediaTek.
      </p>
      <p>
        I value freedom and impact. Away from a screen, you’ll find me playing
        drums, practicing tennis, or traveling.
      </p>
    </div>
    <section
      class="content-section body-copy"
      id="podcast"
      aria-labelledby="podcast-heading"
    >
      <h2 id="podcast-heading">Conversations</h2>
      <p>
        I co-hosted Moonshot with Jason, meeting people across technology,
        business, and life abroad. I’m now preparing a new show with Nash. The
        name and launch date are still to come.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/4ytjr50iW6kEt5bLUNmVwe"
          >Listen to Moonshot →</a
        >
      </p>
    </section>
    <details class="translation" lang="zh-Hant">
      <summary>中文介紹</summary>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <p>
          我是 Tony，住在灣區，從事軟體工程與廣告科技。工作之外，我喜歡探索 AI
          產品、研究投資，也喜歡認識不同領域的人。
        </p>
        <p>
          2019 年，我曾到灣區參加 42 學校的 Piscine。後來從台灣、英國
          Southampton
          交換，到美國求學與工作，我一直想看看更大的世界。曾擔任交大國際學生協會會長，做過
          Chideo 線上中文教育平台，後來共同創辦
          QuantX，也是台灣東吳大學量化交易客座講師，並和 Jason 主持過 Moonshot
          射月計畫。QuantX 團隊也受邀至台灣企業（包含聯發科
          MediaTek）分享量化交易。
        </p>
        <p>
          現在正和 Nash
          籌備新節目，名稱與上線時間未定。自由與影響力是我在意的事；生活裡還有鼓、網球與旅行。
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <p class="content-section body-copy">
      In the Bay Area? <a href="/contact">Let’s grab coffee.</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
